- QSEE MR3000D-04 (hardware sama dgn MR3000D-CI): S - QC_IMAGE_VERSION_STRING=BOOT.BF.3.3.1.1-00066, S - IMAGE_VARIANT_STRING=MAACANAZA → mendukung EL1SWITCH (komunitas boot OpenWrt aarch64 di MR3000D-CI lewat U-Boot 32-bit).
- Layout bootloader MA3063 ≡ MR3000D-CI/04 (0x0–0x900000): SBL1 0x0, MIBIB 0x80000, BOOTCONFIG 0x100000, BOOTCONFIG1 0x140000, QSEE 0x180000, QSEE_1 0x280000, DEVCFG 0x380000, DEVCFG1 0x3c0000, CDT 0x400000, CDT1 0x440000, APPSBLENV 0x480000, APPSBL 0x500000 (1,25MB), APPSBL1 0x640000 (masih stock sebagai fallback), ART 0x780000, TRAINING 0x880000; MR3000D-CI rootfs@0x900000 0x3a00000 vs MA3063 rootfs@0x3b00000 50MB + rootfs1@0x900000.
- Flash QSEE = risiko menengah: TZ gagal init → brick sebelum console; recoverable via CH341A + SNANDer (backup 20/20 terverifikasi di /home/samsul/backup-ma3063). Perlu konfirmasi user lagi (berbeda dari sekadar APPSBL).
- Kondisi saat ini aman: device boot normal ke OpenWrt stok 15.05 (kernel 32-bit stok jalan sempurna di bawah U-Boot komunitas via autoboot UBI volume kernel).
- Env serial: login root/wifi@cmcc → reboot → spam \r; U-Boot: setenv ipaddr 192.168.1.1; setenv serverip 192.168.1.8; setenv ethaddr 9c:2b:a6:ea:21:e9 (ART MAC tidak terbaca di U-Boot komunitas → default 0:11:22:33:44:55); tftpboot 0x44000000; bootm 0x44000000; crc32 verifikasi. Host: enp3s0 192.168.1.8/24, in.tftpd -s /tmp/opencode/tftpboot (PID 9370), /dev/ttyUSB0, internet OK.
- CRC32: appsbl_new.bin=010af46e, stock appsbl.bin=77411145, initramfs itb=7fbdd0b9, test.itb=52856380.
